{"parse": {"title": "FG-05", "pageid": 23009, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FG-04\" title=\"FG-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FG-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/FG-06\" title=\"FG-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FG</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E5.B9.BD.E9.BB.98.E6.95.85.E4.BA.8B.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“幽默故事”\">“幽默故事”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> “幽默故事”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">How to Tell A Story</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>但<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>应<span class=\"color-value\"></span>该<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>话<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191905</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>你好，“断指”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>“小刀”麦高芬——我找到了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiankongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiankongshi\"><img alt=\"jiankongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/600px-Cg-jiankongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/900px-Cg-jiankongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jiankongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>我们今天请到了这次事件真正的亲历者，让我们有请——环状水星女士！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>听闻你找到了那件传说中的黄金，“小刀”麦高芬？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>可否跟我们分享一下你是如何找到它的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>嗯哼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……一切开始于阳光灿烂的一天。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我第一次遇到“断指”，他在街边给我分了一口三明治。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>那个时候，他还只是正在社区大学里学习文学的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>当他拿着一封退学信走进他妈妈弥漫着药味的屋子，并将它递到他妈妈的蓝丝绒枕头上的时候……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>他妈妈将他赶出家门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>从此以后，我要去北方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>他说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>去北方。那里有很多钱赚。那里有一种***父母永远不会知道的豪华生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>一切欣欣向荣，梦想中所有事物都闪闪发光、触手可及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>没有哪个蠢蛋认为自己会锒铛入狱，也没有哪个白痴会想象到自己每周只能看一次电视。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>但那却是文学学士肄业的他后来在狱中唯一的文化生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>你根本等不到好的节目，你只能看广告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>久而久之，广告改变了他，使他变成了一个新的人，使他对这个世界充斥着全新的看法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>商业主义带来的最大“成就”就是我们所有人的生活都在贬值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>我们拥抱商品货物上的标签；我们比较着彼此的生活，更美好的那一方获胜并炸烂另一方的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>如果我有钱，我有足够的钱，我要把我在商铺橱窗里、在电视广告里看到的所有东西都买下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因为电视广告里的人生才是被剥夺的真正的人生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>我所做的一切不过是把我被剥夺的抢回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>只有那样，你才能说我是一个清清白白、堂堂正正，带着不容侵犯的尊严活在这个世界上的人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>你好，“断指”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>“小刀”麦高芬——我找到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>……你找到了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>——你找到了？！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>那只狗？！那只老大每天要沿着海滨遛五趟的***狗？！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我找到它了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>任何从她嘴里冒出来的话语和词汇，都简单轻易得仿佛中午驱车去买一份外带快餐一般。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而她自己从来不会意识到这些话语背后的意义，她只是轻松地将语言罗列出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于那些语言背后所造成的爆炸，她概不负责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>所以你找到了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>是的，休格镇南五十英里的郊野。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>准确来说，是在一片废弃露营地的某块大石头缝里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>它现在在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>就在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>我没有看到除我们俩之外第三个活着并喘息的物种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>它不被允许随身带入探监室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>你的意思是说，“小刀”麦高芬现在正在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只需要稍加联想，此时此刻，那只世界上最宝贵的黄金小狗，正在和狱警一起玩多米诺骨牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我会带着它，直到你明天出狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“断指”用他闪烁着鼠兽般光芒的眼神直勾勾盯着环状水星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>好的——好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>那说说、说说看，你们——噢不，你……你是怎么找到它的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩并未做出回应，她只是犀利地回望着“断指”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>倒不如你说一说，我的同伴现在被你绑架到哪里了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>你……在说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我的同伴，皮克勒斯，昨天晚上被你的人手绑架了，请告诉我原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“断指”掰着他的手指，发出“喀哒喀哒”的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>好吧。是的，是我叫人把它绑架了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>极致的沉默弥漫在空气中，仿佛一点就着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>你做了一件错事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>它会损伤你的能量，使你的能量变得更浑浊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>你现在的能量，已经距我曾经认识的你，相差甚远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>警惕，它将为你招致不幸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>伙计，而我认识你的时候你还没有学会威胁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>这是我们这些街头讨生活的人要学习的第一步，不是吗？永远不要相信他人，永远要给自己留下一个后手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>我以为你早就知道这些潜规则。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>当你得知了“小刀”麦高芬的位置时，我要如何保证你能将它完整地交给我而不是自己私吞呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的话中带有一股熟悉的味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>街头、垃圾堆、被咬了一口的三明治、献血。是的，她旅途中可能会途经的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星眨了眨眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>或许你说得没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>但这不是我的规则。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“断指”脸上的表情微妙地变化了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>噗……哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>环状水星女士……不知道为什么，我有时候觉得你天真得可爱，有时候又觉得你冷酷得残忍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>你看上去像是掌握了某种幽默故事的要领。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>马克·吐温曾经在一本书里这么说过：“幽默故事要依靠讲故事的方法所产生的效果……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>“幽默故事需要被严肃地讲述，讲故事的人要尽量假装他讲的故事根本就没什么好笑的。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在危机时刻夸夸其谈，永远是不入流的文学爱好者的某种特色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>说实话，这种情况下，你不答应也得答应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>如何？明晚七点整，监狱后街的黑铁森林，带上“小刀”麦高芬，我们不见不散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>令人难过的是，马克·吐温确实说过这话。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FG-05"}}